This license covers the source code of ZZZ Toolkit only. It does NOT cover:

  * the anti-blur component written by Ex_M (Bilibili UID 44434084) -
    loader.exe and zencen.dll. That component is the author's work and its
    copyright belongs to the author. It is bundled in the *release package*
    (ZZZToolkit-<version>-portable.zip) purely for convenience so that users
    only need one download; no modification has been made to it. If the author
    asks for its removal, it will be removed immediately. A release without
    that component is also published (ZZZToolkit-<version>-noblur.zip).

  * the games themselves and their trademarks, which belong to their owners.

The Sleepy file-format decoding was written from public community discussion
(CollapseLauncher/Collapse#466 and fffonion/ZZZConfigManager); it is an
independent implementation.
